WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.430
Start in an ordinary vault. A project adds a Board and records beside your notes.

2
00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:07.920
Open Settings.

3
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.530
Choose Features.

4
00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:15.110
Enable Agents to reveal Projects. No T3 connection is needed.

5
00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.830
Close Settings.

6
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.590
Open the app menu.

7
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.200
Choose Projects.

8
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.740
Projects lists the project folders in this vault. None yet.

9
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.480
Choose New project.

10
00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.950
Folder: use an existing folder, Kitchen remodel.

11
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:42.610
Name the project.

12
00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:47.560
Keep Knowledge. Leave Create the project in T3 unchecked.

13
00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:52.250
Choose Create project.

14
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.860
The folder is now a project. Open it.

15
00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:02.290
Board, Decisions, Reports and Handovers are the project tabs. Manager is optional.

16
00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:05.860
Choose Create board.

17
00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:10.520
Keep the title, then Create board. Repository is optional.

18
00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:14.080
Open Local cards.

19
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.660
Choose Add card.

20
00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.890
Enter a task. Todo is the default state.

21
00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:25.440
Choose Save card.

22
00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:29.000
Return to Manage board.

23
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:33.560
Close Manage board.

24
00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:39.160
Expand the queue: the saved card is on the Board.

25
00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:43.620
Open Decisions: read-only notes from the decisions folder.

26
00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:49.230
Select a decision to read it.

27
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:54.830
Reports reads the reports folder the same way.

28
00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:58.330
Return to Board.

29
00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:02.950
Choose Files to return to your notes.

30
00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:06.550
Projects in the top bar reopens a project.

31
00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:15.333
Select Kitchen remodel. Its Board kept the card.
